{{!
    @template local_nttchat/user_results

    Kết quả tìm người. Nút bên phải mỗi dòng mang data-action do JS chọn (direct-message / select-user / add-member).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "action": "select-user",
        "label": "Add",
        "users": [
            {"id": 2, "fullname": "An Nguyen", "profileimageurlsmall": "https://example.com/a.png"}
        ]
    }
}}
{{#users}}
    <li class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between py-1" data-userid="{{id}}">
        <span class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
            <img src="{{profileimageurlsmall}}" alt="" class="nttchat-avatar" width="28" height="28">
            <span>{{fullname}}</span>
        </span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-action="{{action}}"
                data-userid="{{id}}" data-fullname="{{fullname}}">{{label}}</button>
    </li>
{{/users}}
{{^users}}
    <li class="text-muted small">{{#str}}nosearchresults, local_nttchat{{/str}}</li>
{{/users}}
